# No em dashes

Do not use `—` (em dash) or `–` (en dash). Anywhere: UI, titles, toasts, comments, rules, or replies to the user.

Use a period, a comma, a colon, or parentheses.

```
Bad: Quiet mode after about six months — not forever nagging
Good: Quiet mode after about six months. Not forever nagging.
```
